# Store text files with LF in the repository; check them out with the platform's native
# endings. Stops the "LF will be replaced by CRLF" noise and keeps diffs clean.
* text=auto
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
